-border zcs-font-14 zcs-font-normal zcs-lh-body&quot; href=&quot;#Form:Add_Hearing?Case=&lt;%=caseRec.ID%&gt;&amp;amp;zc_LoadIn=dialog&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;zcs-button-icon zc-li-outline ui-1-simple-add&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;zcs-button-text&quot;&gt;Add Hearing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;cd-scroll&quot;&gt;\n&lt;%\n\t\tif(hearingRows.count() == 0)\n\t\t{\n%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-nodata-wrapper zcs-wh-full zcs-flex zcs-align-items-center zcs-justify-center zcs-text-center&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-nodata-content zcs-p-20 zcs-box-border&quot;&gt;&lt;h5 class=&quot;zcs-nodata-header zcs-font-18 zcs-font-medium zcs-lh-heading zcs-color-primary zcs-mt-10 zcs-mx-0 zcs-mb-0&quot;&gt;No hearings scheduled&lt;/h5&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;cd-empty-text&quot;&gt;Add hearings, mediations, conferences, or trial dates as they are scheduled.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;\n&lt;%\n\t\t}\n\t\telse\n\t\t{\n%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;div class=&quot;zcs-table-wrapper zcs-rounded-sm zcs-box-border zcs-relative&quot;&gt;&lt;table class=&quot;zcs-w-full cd-table&quot;&gt;&lt;thead&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Type&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Date / Time&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Venue&lt;/th&gt;&lt;th class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8 zcs-text-left zcs-font-14 zcs-font-medium zcs-color-primary&quot;&gt;Status&lt;/th&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/thead&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;\n&lt;%\n\t\t\tfor each h in hearingRows\n\t\t\t{\n%&gt;\n\t\t\t\t\t&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8&quot;&gt;&lt;%=ifnull(h.Hearing_Type,&quot;-&quot;)%&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td class=&quot;zcs-px-16 zcs-py-8&quot;&gt;&lt;%=ifnull(h.Hearing_DateTime,&quot;-&quot;)%&gt;&lt;/