						            disable Case_Number, Case_Status, Conflict_Status, Engagement_Status, Billing_Status, Opened_On, Closed_On, Archived_On;
						            hide Litigation_Details, Court, Court_Case_Number, Filing_Date, Limitation_Date;
						            hide Corporate_Details, Transaction_Counterparty, Transaction_Value, Execution_Target_Date;
						            hide Compliance_Details, Regulator, Compliance_Due_Date;
						        }
						        actions
						        {
						            custom deluge script
						            (
						                if(input.Case_Type != null)
						                {
						                    caseTypeRec = Add_Case_Type[ID == input.Case_Type];
						                    if(caseTypeRec.count() > 0)
						                    {
						                        if(caseTypeRec.Process_Template in {"Litigation","Arbitration"})
						                        {
						                            show Litigation_Details, Court, Court_Case_Number, Filing_Date, Limitation_Date;
						                        }
						                        if(caseTypeRec.Process_Template == "Corporate Advisory")
						                        {
						                            show Corporate_Details, Transaction_Counterparty, Transaction_Value, Execution_Target_Date;
						                        }
						                        if(caseTypeRec.Process_Template == "Compliance")
						                        {
						                            show Compliance_Details, Regulator, Compliance_Due_Date;
						                        }
						                    }
						                }
						            )
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			Create_Case_On_Success as "Create Case On Success"
			{
			
						    type = form
						    form = Create_Case
						    record event = on add
						
						    on success
						    {
						        actions
						        {
						            custom deluge script
						            (
						                input.Opened_On = zoho.currentdate;
						                insert into Add_Case_History
						                [
						                    Case = input.ID
						                    Event_Date = zoho.currenttime
						                    Event_Type = "Case Created"
						                    Summary = "Matter created and captured in New Intake."
						                ];
						                managerEmail = "";
						                attorneyEmail = "";
						                if(input.Matter_Manager != null)
						                {
						                    managerRec = Add_Employee[ID == input.Matter_Manager];
						                    if(managerRec.count() > 0)
						                    {
						                        managerEmail = ifnull(managerRec.Email,"");
						                    }
						                }
						                if(input.Lead_Attorney != null)
						                {
						                    attorneyRec = Add_Employee[ID == input.Lead_Attorney];
						                    if(attorneyRec.count() > 0)
						                    {
						                        attorneyEmail = ifnull(attorneyRec.Email,"");
						                    }
						                }
						                notifyTo = managerEmail;
						                if(attorneyEmail != "" && attorneyEmail != managerEmail)
						                {
						                    notifyTo = notifyTo + "," + attorneyEmail;
						                }
						                if(notifyTo != "")
						                {
						                    sendmail
						                    (
						                        from : zoho.adminuserid
						                        to : notifyTo
						                        subject : "New legal matter created"
						                        message : "A new matter has been created: " + input.Case_Title
						                    )
						                }
						            )
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			Create_Case_On_Validate as "Create Case On Validate"
			{
			
						    type = form
						    form = Create_Case
						    record event = on add or edit
						
						    on validate
						    {
						        actions
						        {
						            custom deluge script
						            (
						                if(input.Client != null)
						                {
						                    clientRec = Add_Client[ID == input.Client];
						                    if(clientRec.count() > 0 && clientRec.Client_Status == "Blacklisted")
						                    {
						                        alert "Cannot create or update a matter for a blacklisted client.";
						                        cancel submit;
						                    }
						                }
						                if(input.Case_Status != "New Intake" && (input.Lead_Attorney == null || input.Matter_Manager == null))
						                {
						                    alert "Lead Attorney and Matter Manager are required before moving beyond New Intake.";
						                    cancel submit;
						                }
						                if(input.Case_Type != null)
						                {
						                    caseTypeRec = Add_Case_Type[ID == input.Case_Type];
						                    if(caseTypeRec.count() > 0)
						                    {
						                        if(caseTypeRec.Process_Template in {"Litigation","Arbitration"} && (input.Court == null || input.Filing_Date == null || input.Limitation_Date == null))
						                        {
						                            alert "Court, Filing Date, and Limitation Date are required for litigation and arbitration matters.";
						                            cancel submit;
						                        }
						                        if(caseTypeRec.Process_Template == "Compliance" && (input.Regulator in {"",null} || input.Compliance_Due_Date == null))
						                        {
						                            alert "Regulator and Compliance Due Date are required for compliance matters.";
						                            cancel submit;
						                        }
						                        if(caseTypeRec.Process_Template == "Corporate Advisory" && (input.Execution_Target_Date == null || ifnull(input.Transaction_Value,0) <= 0))
						                        {
						                            alert "Execution Target Date and Transaction Value are required for corporate advisory matters.";
						                            cancel submit;
						                        }
						                    }
						                }
						                if(input.Filing_Date != null && input.Limitation_Date != null && input.Limitation_Date < input.Filing_Date)
						                {
						                    alert "Limitation Date cannot be before Filing Date.";
						                    cancel submit;
						                }
						            )
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			Create_Invoice_Case_On_User_Input as "Case On User Input"
			{
			
						    type = form
						    form = Create_Invoice
						    record event = on add or edit
						
						    on user input of Case
						    {
						        actions
						        {
						            custom deluge script
						            (
						                if(input.Case != null)
						                {
						                    caseRec = Create_Case[ID == input.Case];
						                    if(caseRec.count() > 0)
						                    {
						                        input.Client = caseRec.Client;
						                        if(input.Due_Date == null && input.Invoice_Date != null)
						                        {
						                            input.Due_Date = input.Invoice_Date.addDay(30);
						                        }
						                        input.Payment_Terms = "Net 30";
						                    }
						                }
						            )
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			Create_Invoice_On_Load as "Create Invoice On Load"
			{
			
						    type = form
						    form = Create_Invoice
						    record event = on add or edit
						
						    on load
						    {
						        actions
						        {
						            hide System_Info, Invoice_Number;
						            disable Invoice_Number, Invoice_Status, Subtotal, Total_Amount, Amount_Paid, Balance_Due, Sent_On;
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			Create_Invoice_On_Success as "Create Invoice On Success"
			{
			
						    type = form
						    form = Create_Invoice
						    record event = on add or edit
						
						    on success
						    {
						        actions
						        {
						            custom deluge script
						            (
						                insert into Add_Case_History
						                [
						                    Case = input.Case
						                    Event_Date = zoho.currenttime
						                    Event_Type = "Invoice Updated"
						                    New_Status = input.Invoice_Status
						                    Summary = "Invoice " + input.Invoice_Status + " with balance " + input.Balance_Due
						                    Changed_By = input.Prepared_By
						                    Source_Record_ID = input.ID
						                ];
						            )
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			Create_Invoice_On_Validate as "Create Invoice On Validate"
			{
			
						    type = form
						    form = Create_Invoice
						    record event = on add or edit
						
						    on validate
						    {
						        actions
						        {
						            custom deluge script
						            (
						                if(input.Invoice_Date != null && input.Due_Date != null && input.Due_Date < input.Invoice_Date)
						                {
						                    alert "Due Date cannot be before Invoice Date.";
						                    cancel submit;
						                }
						                if(input.Billing_Period_Start != null && input.Billing_Period_End != null && input.Billing_Period_End < input.Billing_Period_Start)
						                {
						                    alert "Billing Period End cannot be before Billing Period Start.";
						                    cancel submit;
						                }
						                if(ifnull(input.Subtotal,0) < 0 || ifnull(input.Tax_Amount,0) < 0 || ifnull(input.Discount_Amount,0) < 0 || ifnull(input.Amount_Paid,0) < 0)
						                {
						                    alert "Invoice amounts cannot be negative.";
						                    cancel submit;
						                }
						            )
						        }
						    }
						
			}

			User_Input4 as "User-Input"
			{
			
						
										type =  form
										form = Create_Template
						
										record event = on add or edit
						
										on user input of Email_For
										{
											actions 
											{
												custom deluge script
												(
																	input.plain = thisapp.getNotesContent(input.Email_For);
												)
											}
										}
						
									
						
			}

			User_Input5 as "User-Input"
			{
			
						
										type =  form
										form = Create_Template
						
										record event = on add or edit
						
										on user input of Select_Template
										{
											actions 
